Alex the Allegator 4: the keys
==============================

  Cursor left/right   walk
  Cursor up           (on the menus) up
  Cursor down         (on the menus) down
  Alt                 jump
  Ctrl                fire: spit out what Alex has eaten
  Space or Return     choose on the menus, skip the intro and the end
  Esc                 back to the menu, or quit from it
  F12                 a screenshot, saved as User/a4_000.png and on

On the main menu Options sets the window size, full screen, colour or the
original GameBoy greens, and the sound. Your settings, high scores and how
many cherries and stars you have found on each level are kept in the
drawer's User drawer (config.ini, highscore.dat); the start-up log is
User/log.txt.

To play your own levels, start it from a Shell with your level list:

    Alex4 Work:MyLevels/levels.txt
